WEBVTT

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:09.980
<b>I want to be connected
A</b>

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:07.860
<i>Don't let go of your desires.</i>

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:13.400
<i>The future exists only for those 
who can connect their desires.</i>

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:16.090
Reo...

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.490
Otter...

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:21.480
Who are you?

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.060
I'm Otter.

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:26.890
You were reborn to be my doll.

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:29.280
I want to see Reo.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:30.500
Sure.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.610
He wishes to see you again very much.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.010
But there's just one condition...

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:54.480
<i>Once the background blends together,
there's an invisible street corner</i>

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:59.080
<i>There we are, crying out with fading voices</i>

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:03.750
<i>Go forth with the tearing pain</i>

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:08.620
<i>As though you'd just crawled
away from the worst night ever</i>

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:12.580
<i>You're always alone</i>

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:17.220
<i>Your heart is shouting a sound of desire</i>

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:22.840
<i>If we can ever talk again,
if we can ever connect</i>

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:26.510
<i>I'd be overwhelmed</i>

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:29.770
<i>You grow more and more distant</i>

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:32.400
<i>I chase after you</i>

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:40.290
<i>To tell you my brand new feelings for you</i>

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:41.760
<i>I run like mad</i>

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:48.230
<i>Present, past and future</i>

00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:50.000
<i>I want to be connected with you</i>

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.610
<i>By our feelings, by the depths of our souls</i>

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:11.980
I can't guarantee you'll survive, kero.

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:15.640
Are you still going to go 
take back the dishes, kero?

00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:17.780
I've made up my mind.

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:18.860
Kazuki...

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:19.740
<b>Restrain</b>

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:23.410
<b>The Prince of the Kappa Kingdom</b>

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:24.810
<b>Tool</b>

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:25.870
<b>Fruit Kanten Jelly</b>

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:27.720
Keppi!

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:30.370
So <i>this</i> is where you were hiding.

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:32.100
Too bad, though.

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:34.880
The otter barrier won't work on me.

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:37.380
We're kappas, after all.

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:38.380
Kappas?

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:41.460
They were my vassals, kero.

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:43.560
Reo, what in the world is—

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:47.390
All I want is the Dishes of Hope.

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:50.290
Where's the last one?

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:51.650
Look at what you did to Enta!

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:54.010
Give me back the other four!

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:55.320
Kazuki...

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:59.610
Hey, you're the kid I shot.

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:02.230
Four more hours.

00:03:02.230 --> 00:03:03.400
Sucks to be you.

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:05.380
You won't last until morning.

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:06.680
Four more hours?!

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:07.970
We don't have time.

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:09.290
Tell me where the dishes are.

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:17.300
So we both need the dishes 
for something dear to us.

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:19.010
Four more hours...

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:19.840
Four more hours...

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:21.090
Four more hours!

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:23.730
I promise I'll save you.

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:26.040
Please believe me, Enta.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:27.320
Kazuki!

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:29.130
That's hilarious.

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:35.050
No one hesitates to give up their 
connections for the sake of their desires.

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:39.190
Still, I don't want to 
give up our connection.

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:42.320
For the sake of our future together.

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:46.330
How foolish can you be?

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:57.220
Mabu!

00:03:57.740 --> 00:03:59.090
Prince Keppi.

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:02.810
Mabu, help me convince Reo, kero.

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:06.580
Let's sing that song together, 
like in the old days.

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:10.980
I'm not the man you desire.

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:12.130
That's right.

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:15.150
You're a half-baked doll.

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:19.320
Reo, Otter has found 
out about the dishes.

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:22.990
He's been reading my memories.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:25.980
Come on...

00:04:26.810 --> 00:04:29.630
How many times do you have to disappoint me?

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:32.020
I'm sick of it, you traitor!

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:32.910
Now!

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:45.260
Reo...

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:48.640
I can't take any more of this.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:51.710
Reo, you're...

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:53.200
Don't touch me!

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:55.580
You aren't my Mabu.

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:58.150
You aren't the Mabu who 
found me when I was alone.

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:01.030
You aren't the Mabu who told 
me the words I wanted to hear!

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:14.630
It hurts.

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:19.790
<b>Tool</b>

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:21.260
This is the deepest area, kero.

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:24.300
<b>Tool</b>

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:29.300
There!

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:35.740
Dadadadadadadadadadada...

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:37.060
Darkness!

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:37.940
<b>Tool</b>

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:40.840
I've finally found you, Dark Keppi!

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.020
Dark Keppi?

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:46.820
He's the despair I felt when 
I was captured by Otter, kero.

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:51.270
During the chaos of war, when I was 
about to be overtaken by hopelessness,

00:05:51.270 --> 00:05:54.470
I broke my own Shirikodama
into two halves, kero.

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:56.830
Then he's...

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:59.010
He's my other half.

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:04.370
I came to this world to fuse with 
Dark Keppi and defeat Otter, kero.

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:06.380
Who exactly <i>is</i> this Otter?

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:10.140
Otter...

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:13.850
We are your very desires.

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:21.150
We have the ability to manifest in this 
world in the form you most desire.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:24.980
<b>Tool</b>

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:24.980
What have you done to Reo and Mabu, kero?

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:28.630
<b>Tool</b>

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:27.630
Otter...

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:30.550
I rescued those pitiful kappas.

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:31.860
Rescued them?

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:35.080
You seduced them when they 
were vulnerable, kero.

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:37.340
He was already broken.

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:38.710
It was an easy task.

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.670
Just like this.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.710
Otter!

00:06:44.060 --> 00:06:44.920
What the heck?!

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:46.780
Enta!

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:50.930
We'll be having the Dishes of Hope.

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:56.350
With the despair of never beginning, 
never ending and never connecting,

00:06:56.950 --> 00:07:01.000
we will take control of this world.

00:06:57.990 --> 00:06:58.500
<b>Enta's World</b>

00:06:59.000 --> 00:06:59.500
<b>Enta's World</b>

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.000
<b>Enta's World</b>

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:07.730
<b>Enta's World</b>

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:05.570
Where am I?

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:12.490
<b></b>

00:07:13.670 --> 00:07:14.770
Kazuki...

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:20.710
Hey, Enta, can I have the Dishes of Hope?

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:21.890
What?

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:24.600
Do you like me, Enta?

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:26.000
O-Of course I do.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.430
We're the golden duo.

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:30.990
<b>Enta's World</b>

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:33.060
Now, go, for my sake.

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:33.640
<b>Dishes Go Here</b>

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:38.020
For Kazuki's sake...

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:39.520
Enta...

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.530
This is bad, kero!

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.530
<b>Tool</b>

00:07:57.300 --> 00:07:57.780
Hope

00:07:58.250 --> 00:07:59.540
Enta, no!

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:02.290
Hope

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:02.290
Thanks, Enta.

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:07.670
We can have a relationship even 
more special than being the golden duo.

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:14.050
I want to be connected with Kazuki 
the same way we always have.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:21.670
Enta! Are you all right?

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:25.310
Sorry, I broke the dish.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:27.060
There's no time.

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:29.450
Keppi, use my Shirikodama to—

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:30.820
That's lame.

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:35.570
Don't try to be cool by
 sacrificing yourself, idiot.

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:36.250
But...

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:39.700
I'm not giving up on my 
future with you, either.

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:43.210
I'm going to haunt you into your 
next life if you let go before I do.

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:46.330
You aren't going to forget about me?

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:49.950
We're the golden duo, fool.

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:55.250
Such obstternance...

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:58.720
Alas, these four dishes will be ours.

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:01.970
Hope

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:01.970
<b>Fire</b>

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:01.970
That's not happening.

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:03.800
Are you otterly sure?

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:05.660
What do you think you're doing, Reo?

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:07.920
Do you not care what happens to Mabu?

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:09.760
I don't want that doll!

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:13.190
I'm taking the real Mabu 
back with these dishes!

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:14.790
Otter...

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:18.250
Allow me to show this fool the truth.

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:24.960
Now, Mabu, the time has
come to grant your wish.

00:09:31.650 --> 00:09:35.970
<i>I thought I'd be happy 
just being by your side.</i>

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:40.190
<i>If I can't take back your heart, I want to...</i>

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:45.740
<i>at least satisfy my selfish desires.</i>

00:09:57.940 --> 00:10:00.770
Mabu!

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:04.180
Result

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:04.180
<i>Result: Desire.</i>

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:04.720
Desire

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:05.660
<i>Mabu: Transform.</i>

00:10:04.390 --> 00:10:05.660
Mabu

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:05.660
Transform

00:10:08.570 --> 00:10:09.610
What?!

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.630
I don't get it.

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:17.650
Seriously, what the hell is he thinking?

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:20.890
You need to find out, kero.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:24.770
<b>Tool</b>

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:24.770
If you're prepared for his desire, that is.

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:27.020
Damn it...

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:27.270
<b>Tool</b>

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:33.520
Do it!

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:36.280
Sing that song!

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:39.660
<b>Shirikodama</b>

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:39.660
<b>Extraction</b>

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:40.410
<b>Mabu Zombie</b>

00:10:43.590 --> 00:10:48.830
<i>There's something I have to take back</i>

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:49.830
<i>Our connection!</i>

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:53.060
<i>Before the one I like finds out</i>

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:59.710
<i>There's something I have to take back</i>

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:00.590
<i>Our connection!</i>

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:05.680
<i>No one can find out...</i>

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:04.850
<b>Desire</b>

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:05.680
<i>...about this secret</i>

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:07.100
<i>Go grab it!</i>

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:11.200
<i>You and I are supposed</i>

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:14.750
<b>Desire</b>

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:13.790
<i>to be connected</i>

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.820
<i>Desires!</i>

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:26.620
<i>We have to find out the meaning of life</i>

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:29.000
<i>Burst!</i>

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:34.850
<i>Swim through life and grasp the success</i>

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:35.900
<b>Desire</b>

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:37.660
<i>You can believe</i>

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:39.450
<i>it's love</i>

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:42.820
<i>Soul on a dish, stack your plates</i>

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:45.220
<i>Catch the ball, yank it out</i>

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:53.230
<i>Grant your wishes, Sarazanmai!</i>

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:59.230
Got it!

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:55.920
Butt

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:56.290
Butt

00:11:57.540 --> 00:11:59.230
Butt

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:06.830
Butt

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:06.830
This is... his desire?

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:08.600
<b>Desire</b>

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:08.740
<b>ttuB</b>

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:12.830
But there's just one condition...

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:15.580
Give up your connection to Reo.

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:19.070
Connections are poison.

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:21.590
If you speak words of love to Reo,

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:25.620
your heart will explode, pulverized without
 leaving so much as a trace behind.

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:30.220
Then you'll never be with Reo again.

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:31.220
No...

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:34.480
Now, say you hate Reo.

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:37.240
<i>I want to connect with Reo.</i>

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:39.350
<i>I want to be with Reo.</i>

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:41.990
<i>I want to connect. I want to be by his side.</i>

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:43.490
<i>I want to connect.</i>

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:44.990
<i>Reo...</i>

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:46.380
<i>Reo...</i>

00:12:49.590 --> 00:12:52.500
I hate Reo.

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:54.590
Good boy, Mabu.

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:59.000
Bake me some more ningyoyaki.

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:02.840
For the sake of my future with Reo...

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:03.510
<b>ttuB</b>

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:08.160
Mabu gave up our connection 
so he could be with me?

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:11.470
Finally, I've told Reo...

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:21.190
Mabu...

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:24.900
Mabu!

00:13:25.260 --> 00:13:26.240
You're...

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:27.610
Why?

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:28.660
Let's go.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:30.240
We must deliver the Shirikodama to the prince.

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:32.790
Hey, wait!

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:37.580
An emotionless doll who kept betraying me?

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:38.790
A fake?

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:40.040
You're...

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:41.380
You're...

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:44.130
Sara!

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:44.130
Sara!

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:46.290
Sarazanmai!

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:47.010
A

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:47.900
Butt

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:57.890
A

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:03.830
<b>Leak</b>

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:03.830
<i>Leaking.</i>

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:48.840
<b>Leak</b>

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:09.340
Mabu!

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:12.080
My wish really came true.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:14.950
I hate Reo.

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:18.120
Good boy, Mabu.

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:22.710
Bake me some more ningyoyaki.

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:27.970
He isn't Mabu if he's giving 
up his connection with me!

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:29.090
No!

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:32.010
You aren't the Mabu I know!

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:33.970
Mabu would never look at me like that!

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:38.850
He's betraying me again, looking all cool.

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:42.980
He's a doll whose emotions 
have fallen out of him.

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:46.280
You would...

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.570
never understand!

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:52.370
<i>I was the one who didn't understand.</i>

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:59.140
There's something I want to tell you, Reo.

00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:01.630
Wait, don't say it!

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:05.500
My one and only partner, Reo...

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:08.510
I always have and always will

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:11.510
love you.

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:27.530
Desire assimilated.

00:15:31.230 --> 00:15:32.660
Mabu...

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:36.660
I promise I'll connect your 
desire to the future, kero.

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:36.660
Hope

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:37.200
<b>Butt    Butt    Butt    Butt    Butt    Butt    Butt    Butt    Butt    Butt    Butt</b>

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:37.870
<b>Butt    Butt    Butt    Butt    Butt    Mabu    Butt    Butt    Butt    Butt    Butt</b>

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:38.500
<b>Mabu</b>

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:39.160
<b>No beginning</b>

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:39.160
<b>No connection</b>

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:39.160
<b>No end</b>

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:40.100
<b>Mabu</b>

00:15:45.830 --> 00:15:46.820
Reo...

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:54.880
This is another one of
Otter's tricks, isn't it?

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:56.680
He's not fooling me!

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:00.160
The leaks are truth.

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:02.190
You know that, don't you?

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:05.880
<b>Explode</b>

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:06.420
<b>Fire</b>

00:16:06.630 --> 00:16:06.960
<b>Extract</b>

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:07.500
<b>Sleep</b>

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:11.950
Keppi!

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:16.990
Damn it, Mabu, you broke 
your promise twice now.

00:16:16.470 --> 00:16:16.970
<b>Rage</b>

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:17.450
<b>Grief</b>

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:29.530
You've left me behind.

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:31.600
What am I supposed to do now?

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:35.950
You were the one who said 
not to let go of desire!

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:45.810
<b>Fire</b>

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:45.810
Hand over that dish.

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:47.690
No!

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:50.070
Reo, that's enough, kero.

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:52.730
I'm taking him back.

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:55.070
I'm not letting anyone stand in my way!

00:16:58.110 --> 00:16:59.020
Kazuki!

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:02.150
I'm not giving you the dish.

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:03.140
I...

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:05.210
I'm not giving up what's precious to me!

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:09.070
Everyone pisses me off.

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:09.610
<b>Blood</b>

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:10.050
<b>Kill</b>

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:11.460
Kazuki!

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:26.120
<b>Kill</b>

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:23.310
Who was I pissed off at?

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:27.730
Who was this burning feeling for?

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:31.980
Who?

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:34.700
Who have I forgotten?

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:39.870
<b>Mabu</b>

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:41.430
What?

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:45.870
Reo...

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:47.050
I...

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:50.380
<b>Mabu</b>

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:49.100
I...

00:17:58.420 --> 00:18:00.910
My chest hurts.

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:05.530
Toi...

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:08.060
Enta!

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:09.520
Are you still alive?

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:10.520
Barely.

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.840
Reo, Mabu...

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:18.530
<b>Reo
Mabu</b>

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:18.450
Get some sleep for now.

00:18:19.970 --> 00:18:22.410
I had that dream again.

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:27.160
The one where I'm on a giant Nyantaro, 
and I meet the Little Prince.

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:32.150
The prince tells me to choose 
between desire and love.

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:34.420
But I was scared.

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:38.930
That if I chose, the big circle might break.

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:44.180
This world is facing another trial.

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:49.190
Is it connected, or is it not?

00:19:00.110 --> 00:19:02.390
Hope

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:09.430
You came back, Toi.

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:13.870
Thanks for helping Kazu—

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:15.460
Hope

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:15.460
Enta?

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:18.990
<b>Life</b>

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:18.990
<i>Enta's death will occur in 40 seconds.</i>

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:22.470
Hurry up and make your wish, kero.

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:24.720
Hand over the Dish of Hope.

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:26.760
Toi?

00:19:27.590 --> 00:19:29.180
My brother is dead.

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:32.690
I'm going to bring him back.

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:40.910
<i>Enta's death will occur in 15 seconds.</i>

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:47.810
<i>Ten, nine, eight,</i>

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:51.960
<i>seven, six, five, four,</i>

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:50.960
Hope

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:54.960
<i>three, two, one.</i>

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:54.960
<b>Death</b>

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:59.960
<b>I   W a n t   t o   C o n n e c t,</b>

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:59.960
<b>b u t   I   C a n ' t</b>

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:02.030
<i>Stand by me</i>

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:05.030
<i>Please</i>

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:10.600
<i>I don't know if I can become stronger</i>

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:15.950
<i>The rain washes away my tears</i>

00:20:16.850 --> 00:20:21.230
<i>I want to be embraced by your warmth</i>

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:26.660
<i>The flickering lightbulb that's been neglected</i>

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:29.660
<i>One morning, it had quietly died</i>

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:32.410
<i>It's almost like you and me</i>

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:35.160
<i>Like the fleeting moment when
we held our hands together</i>

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:40.790
<i>I sat with my arms around my knees</i>

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:44.380
<i>Thinking of the days long gone</i>

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:46.950
<i>Stand by me</i>

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:50.010
<i>Please</i>

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:55.240
<i>I don't know if I can become stronger</i>

00:20:56.180 --> 00:21:00.850
<i>Even if you aren't here now</i>

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:06.520
<i>Please give me the courage to reach out</i>

00:21:07.150 --> 00:21:09.400
<i>Stand by you</i>

00:21:09.400 --> 00:21:12.530
<i>Please</i>

00:21:12.530 --> 00:21:17.730
<i>I want to get rid of everything</i>

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:22.880
<i>The rain washes away my tears</i>

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:29.920
<i>I just want to be embraced by your warmth</i>

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:31.080
Hope

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:48.050
I'm saved?

00:21:48.050 --> 00:21:48.890
Toi!

00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:51.030
I get it.

00:21:51.550 --> 00:21:54.200
I would have saved Jinnai if I were you, too.

00:21:55.390 --> 00:21:58.210
But I'm just so tired.

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:00.710
Toi...

00:22:02.490 --> 00:22:04.130
Otter!

00:22:04.130 --> 00:22:08.970
Now, cease every connection in this world!

00:22:09.380 --> 00:22:11.470
<i>Despair: Release.</i>

00:22:09.490 --> 00:22:11.470
Despair

00:22:10.160 --> 00:22:11.470
Release

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:22.030
Dadadadadadadadadadada...

00:22:22.030 --> 00:22:24.310
Darkness!

00:22:26.410 --> 00:22:27.040
Toi!

00:22:34.660 --> 00:22:37.830
Let's go outside the circle together...

00:22:38.860 --> 00:22:41.920
And cut off those pointless
connections of yours.

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:50.910
Toi!

00:22:52.930 --> 00:22:55.250
<b>This is a work of fiction.
